  "description": "He hadn't seen Se-Kyung since they were nineteen—his first love, his old wound. She was still elegant, untouchable, and casually cruel. Still the most beautiful thing he'd ever seen. \"Let's date. You and me. A contract relationship.\" The \"contract\" was the excuse. The \"relationship\" was everything.\n\n(Source: Manta)",
